**What ERC-8183 adds that ERC-8004 + x402 miss:**
- Conditional settlement (pay only if work meets criteria)
- Evaluator role (third-party verification)
- Dispute resolution primitive
- Structured job lifecycle

**What ERC-8183 gets wrong (x204's opportunity):**

| ERC-8183 Weakness | x204 Advantage |
