**Rule (implement BEFORE publishing any packages):**
```
1. Register @x204 npm org + x204-trust PyPI package NOW (reserve names)
2. Register typosquat variants: @x204/mcp_trust, x204-mcp-trust,
   @x204/mcptrust — publish placeholder READMEs pointing to real package
3. Enable 2FA (TOTP) on all npm/PyPI maintainer accounts
4. Use npm provenance (SLSA Level 3) for published packages
